  "content": "<p>这是开学之前的最后一次旅行了。因为学生票前后两次乘车只要间隔不超过5天就可以只用一次减免次数，所以我觉得这次只在一座城市呆上五天。而乌鲁木齐与沈阳间的省会城市只有银川，太原和呼和浩特我没有去过。这次就选择了其中相对更繁荣的太原市。</p><p>下面是我在这几天中使用松下S5 24-105所拍摄的一些照片。希望喜欢。</p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1094492.webp\" alt=\"纯阳宫\" title=\"纯阳宫\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1094547.webp\" alt=\"山西博物院\" title=\"山西博物院\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1094826.webp\" alt=\"晋祠\" title=\"晋祠\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1094867.webp\" alt=\"晋祠\" title=\"晋祠\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1094931.webp\" alt=\"晋祠\" title=\"晋祠\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095039.webp\" alt=\"晋祠\" title=\"晋祠\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095045.webp\" alt=\"晋祠\" title=\"晋祠\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095123.webp\" alt=\"天龙山\" title=\"天龙山\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095130.webp\" alt=\"天龙山\" title=\"天龙山\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095138.webp\" alt=\"天龙山\" title=\"天龙山\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095158.webp\" alt=\"天龙山\" title=\"天龙山\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095170.webp\" alt=\"天龙山\" title=\"天龙山\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095184.webp\" alt=\"天龙山\" title=\"天龙山\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095198.webp\" alt=\"天龙山\" title=\"天龙山\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavilion/blog-images/raw/master/太原_P1095221.webp\" alt=\"双塔寺\" title=\"双塔寺\"></p><p><img src=\"https://gitee.com/gubei-pavi